<p>You summon your future self to fight alongside you for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns.  At some point in the future, you'll be pulled into the past to fight alongside your past self after the initial effect ends.</p><p>This spell splits the timeline.  Attempting to use another spell that also splits the timeline while this effect is active will be unsuccessful.</p>